  "rulings": {
    "ordinarium.praefatio-nativitatis.w044": "The approved Benziger printing on p. 286 has lower-case accented amórem. The pinned digital body has lower-case unaccented amorem. The selected accent follows the print; no capital typography or unprinted restoration is asserted.",
